[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891742\">4450B13</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892214\">7040L44</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the bolts securing the right and left rear wheel rpm\nsensors.</p><p>2. Disconnect the ABS wheel sensor electrical connections.</p><p>3. Remove the rpm sensors.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Rear right wheel sensor for ABS</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890700\">K76</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Left rear wheel sensor for ABS</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890697\">K75</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034979.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the left and right wheel\nrpm sensors, positioning the electrical wiring correctly.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections.</p><p>Screw in the rpm sensor bolts.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>ABS REAR WHEEL RPM SENSOR</p></td><td><p>M6</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>0.7</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2892214\">7040L44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891742\">4450B13</a></p>"]]